281px\">\r\n\r\n<tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:474.5454406738281px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;width:60px!important;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178);display:block;margin-right:10px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242901598000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2TMOYygGntiMdN6Z97ECy-\"><img border=\"0\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\"></a></td><td style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"margin:0px;font-size:20px;color:rgb(85,85,85)\"><a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/09/26/viquillibre-manual-dr/\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178);text-decoration:none!important\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/09/26/viquillibre-manual-dr/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242901598000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1juxQdPhknK5NHbp6vViLX\">Viquillibre Manual d’R</a></h2>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(136,136,136)\">by <a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/\" style=\"color:rgb(136,136,136)!important\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242901598000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2TMOYygGntiMdN6Z97ECy-\">Lluís Ramon</a></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"margin-top:1em;max-width:560px\">\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4em;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0px 0px 1em\">Fa uns dies en Pep Sala ens va contactar dient-nos que en els darrers mesos havia col·laborant en ampliar el manual d&#39;R que podeu trobar en el següent enllaç. Com que la tasca és prou gran i portar-la sol pot ser una càrrega feixuga instava a veure si hi havia gent del grup d&#39;usuaris d&#39;R [...]</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4em;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0px 0px 1em\"><a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/09/26/viquillibre-manual-dr/\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/09/26/viquillibre-manual-dr/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242901598000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1juxQdPhknK5NHbp6vViLX\">Read more of this post</a></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-size:0.9em;margin-top:4px;line-height:20px;padding:15px 0px;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(238,238,238);overflow:hidden\">\r\n\r\n<strong><a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242901598000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2TMOYygGntiMdN6Z97ECy-\">Lluís Ramon</a></strong> | September 26, 2012 at 4:55 pm | Categories: <a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/category/manuals-dr-packages/\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/category/manuals-dr-packages/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242901598000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Umcl3JxlfzhBg2bNRO4tt\">Manuals d&#39;R &amp; packages</a> | URL: <a href=\"http://wp.me/p1KCUp-ee\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"